title: "IsoParcel: Equal-area polygon partitioning plugin for QGIS"
abstract: "QGIS plugin for equal-area partitioning of irregular polygons into row-by-column grids in cadastral and agricultural applications. An adaptive binary-search cutting algorithm with automatic topological cleaning; successful subdivisions reach an area coefficient of variation below 0.01%."

